  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi Donor Trust Fund for Southern Sudan (MDTF SS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">/ The objective of the trust fund is to provide a vehicle for Donors to pool resources and co-ordinate support to fund the overall reconstructionm and development needs for Southern Sudan during the interim period.The focus will be on recovery and longer-term development activities to support Sudan&apos;s reaching the Millennium Development Goals</narrative>
  </description>
